{"id": 91861, "field": "objectives", "ja": "北にあるFenris Keepを調べ、Earthen Ringの一行の行方不明者を探してください。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q2-quest2-objectives-02-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "0537549292c4b176", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70009"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 91861, "field": "description", "ja": "<見つかった死体が一つだけだったのは希望の持てる兆しだ。TrevanとHadrecが言っていたHigh Elfは、近くの砦のもっと奥でまだ生きているのではないか？>", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q-quest-description-02-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "87c8daeb3485a64c", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70009"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
