{"id": 91921, "field": "objectives", "ja": "Quinnの薬を、Sepulcherの北のIvar PatchにいるQuinn Yorickのところへ持って行ってください。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q2-quest2-objectives-02-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "ed042c3ffb037b53", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70009"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 91921, "field": "description", "ja": "これがQuinnの回復を助ける新しい薬だ。心臓丸ごと6つから抽出した愛情で作ってある。\n\nさて、君がいるとまた書類仕事が増えるので、失礼させてもらうよ。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names", "numbers"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q-quest-description-02-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "0c746cd706de04d8", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70009"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
